            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Tri Hang Restaurant",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nAwesome Local Experience\nDec 2020\nThe seafood here is fresh, delicious and really reasonably priced - especially those amazing grilled oysters! I'm pleased to see this place on TripAdvisor. It is the sort of place that the \"TripAdvisor\" crowd generally spurns. But, the staff was kind of confused by my solo visit in the middle of a nasty, cold rainstorm. But, the food was hot and delicious. It's a great place to eat local-style and get a great taste for the amazing cuisine of Vietnam that exists beyond the fancy spots.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 22, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
