            "review_title": "Review at Tri Hang Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Agsie\nLondon, United Kingdom75 contributions\n0\nbest seafood restaurant!\nNov 2018 • Couples\nbest seafood restaurant I have been to hands down!!!! so cheap as well!! the staff super helpful even though they dont speak much English. The English menu also makes very little sense unless you are a seafood expert (as a frequent-seafood-eater Asian who is bilingual, I struggled!!!)!! The baked oysters very nice and the fried whelks also very fragrant and nice! the sour fish soup was very nice and massive with all the noodles and sides! we were so full and the heat of the weather does not help! super authentic seating with the low chairs as well! Love it!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 20, 2018",
